{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3つめのレポの人狼の前になるんだけど\nもう１つ出てました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電視台⑤スタジオ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電視台②ぶりにスタジオ\n結構な頻度で出させてもらいましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武井壮さんが来てくださいました！！！\n前回の46時間TVの時も来ていただいたのに\nありがたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のことをよく知ってくれていて\n嬉しかったな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"順番前後してごめんね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝からの\n中田が出演したところのレポに戻りますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子の電視台"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回に引き続き\n琴子の電視台にまた出させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子の笑顔を見るべく\n『大車輪てつぼうくん』と『エレクトロマスター』をしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のビリビリは...\n琴子が笑顔になれたなら...\nもう全然いいです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに『大車輪てつぼうくん』\n結構、練習したから\n中田ちょっと上手いです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータリング争奪バトル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月のバッタ\n沈金リスナーはきっと焦ったことでしょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が書かせたわけじゃないよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミドルチームは\nフレンチトーストGetできました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局、ケータリング争奪バトルでは\n3位→2位→1位という結果に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぼりざか～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電視台⑦スタジオ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも出る予定は無かったんですが\n出させてもらったよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ最後のブロックでしたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんの電視台"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の最後の大トリ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の説明も無しに\nとりあえず変な被り物だけ被らされ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何するのか聞いてもよくわからないまま\n不安のまま出ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれで良かったのか今でも謎です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/4184268/0010.jpeg","alt":""},